#: source/concepts/physics-backends/newton.rst:9
msgid "Newton"
msgstr "Newton"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/newton.rst:11
msgid ""
"Newton is a Warp-native backend that can run without Isaac Sim. Its Isaac "
"Lab integration supports multiple solver families. Configure the backend "
"with :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` and choose a solver "
"configuration through its ``solver_cfg`` field."
msgstr ""
"Newton 是 Warp 原生后端，可在不安装 Isaac Sim 的情况下运行。它在 Isaac Lab 中支持多个求解器系列。使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` 配置后端，并通过其 ``solver_cfg`` "
"字段选择求解器配置。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/newton.rst:16
msgid ""
"Task and component coverage is task-specific. Check task ``--help`` and "
":doc:`the environment catalog </source/setup/environments>` for current "
"presets; the presence of a solver configuration does not imply that a task "
"supports it. Start with :doc:`/source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton` "
"before tuning a new asset or task."
msgstr ""
"任务和组件支持范围取决于具体任务。当前可用预设请查看任务的 ``--help`` 和 :doc:`环境目录 "
"</source/setup/environments>` ；存在某个求解器配置，并不意味着任务支持它。调整新资产或任务之前，请先阅读 "
":doc:`/source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton` 。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/newton.rst:23
msgid "Solver options"
