#: source/concepts/physics-backends/newton.rst:25
msgid ""
"The links below cover Isaac Lab configuration and workflows. For solver "
"formulations, feature support, and contact models, use Newton's `solver "
"guide <https://newton-physics.github.io/newton/latest/solvers/index.html>`__"
" and its linked solver references. The generated Isaac Lab APIs remain the "
"source of truth for configuration fields and defaults."
msgstr ""
"下列链接介绍 Isaac Lab 配置和工作流程。求解器公式、功能支持及接触模型，请查阅 Newton 的 `求解器指南 "
"<https://newton-physics.github.io/newton/latest/solvers/index.html>`__ "
"及其链接的求解器参考。配置字段和默认值仍以自动生成的 Isaac Lab API 为准。"

